      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for that, but honestly it's a bit too short for what i need. the library metric is looking pretty low for this entry. \n\ncan you expand on this significantly? i need you to go into more detail regarding the specific experimental setups (like the Aspect experiment) and the actual mathematical formulation of the inequality itself. please make it much more comprehensive and lengthy so it meets the depth requirements, but again—keep it meaningful. i don't want a bunch of repetitive sentences, just a much more exhaustive and technical explanation.",
